---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import DownloadSelector from "../../components/DownloadSelector.astro";
import { getPreviewChannel } from "../../lib/release-channel";

/* The title, description and integrity copy below used to promise per-artifact
   SHA-256 and cleanroom records unconditionally. With no published release the
   body correctly says nothing is available, so the page advertised evidence for
   artifacts that do not exist — in the two strings a search engine indexes and a
   social preview shows, which are also the first thing a reader sees.

   Reading the same channel the selector reads keeps the promise and the artifact
   from disagreeing. */
const channel = await getPreviewChannel();
const published = channel?.targets.some((target) => target.status === "available") ?? false;
/* One manifest covers the whole release, so the first artifact that names one is
   the link for every target. */
const checksumUrl =
  channel?.targets.flatMap((target) => target.artifacts).find((artifact) => artifact.checksumUrl)?.checksumUrl ?? null;
---
<BaseLayout
  title={published ? "下载 OneAgent — 未签名技术预览版" : "下载 OneAgent — 尚未公开发行"}
  description={published
    ? "下载 OneAgent 技术预览版，每个产物都附 GitHub Releases 报告的 SHA-256。"
    : "OneAgent 尚未公开发行。这里会列出各平台产物、体积与 SHA-256，供下载前核对。"}
>
  <header class="page-hero">
    <div class="shell page-hero-grid">
      <div>
        <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="面包屑"><a href="">首页</a> / 下载</nav>
        <p class="eyebrow">Download center</p>
        <h1 class="page-title">{published ? "选好平台，直接开始。" : "还没有可下载的产物。"}</h1>
      </div>
      <div class="page-hero-aside">
        <strong>无需 OneAgent 账号</strong>
        {published
          ? "每个产物都带着版本、体积、构建日期与 SHA-256，下载前你就能核对清楚。"
          : "发行之后，每个产物都会带上版本、体积、构建日期与 SHA-256，供你下载前核对。"}
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>
  <section class="section-compact">
    <div class="shell"><DownloadSelector /></div>
  </section>
  <section class="section section-muted">
    <div class="narrow prose">
      <p class="eyebrow">Integrity</p>
      <h2 class="section-title">{published ? "页面上的 SHA-256 让你可以自己核对。" : "发行之后，页面上的 SHA-256 让你可以自己核对。"}</h2>
      {/* The old copy claimed byte-identical files across "官网、GitHub Release、
          网盘和企业云盘". Only one of those channels exists: the download page
          links to GitHub Releases and prints the digest that feed reports. */}
      <p>产物只通过 GitHub Releases 发行，页面上的 SHA-256 就是该发行流报告的摘要。</p>
      <p>渠道不追加推广文件，不替换安装脚本，不二次签名。</p>
      {/* Linking the published manifest matters more than printing the digest:
          it lets a reader check against the release itself rather than against a
          number this page could have got wrong. */}
      {checksumUrl && (
        <p>也可以直接对照发行流发布的校验清单：<a href={checksumUrl} rel="noopener">SHA256SUMS</a>。</p>
      )}
      <p>算出来的值和页面不一致？别运行它，把下载地址、文件名和实际哈希发到支持页面。</p>
      <h3>当前是技术预览版</h3>
      <p>macOS Developer ID 公证与 Windows Authenticode 还没完成，所以它不叫 Stable。签名、公证与原生验证门禁齐备后，每个平台各自进入 Stable。</p>
      {/* This used to promise the site documented no way around the OS security
          policy. It now does, for macOS, because the alternative was readers
          hitting a "移到废纸篓" dialog with no explanation and no path forward.
          The promise is replaced rather than quietly dropped: what the site still
          refuses to do is weaken the policy itself. */}
      <p>因为未签名，macOS 首次打开会被 Gatekeeper 拦截。<a href="quickstart/#macos-gatekeeper">macOS 首次打开指南</a>说明这一步放行了什么、以及为什么签名版发布后就不再需要它。</p>
      <p>OneAgent 不会让你关闭 Gatekeeper、执行 <code>spctl --master-disable</code> 或降低系统整体安全设置；上述流程只针对这一个应用，且由你逐步确认。</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
